---
import Band from './Band.astro';
---

<Band id="about" surface="reading" label="Why Talent Angels">
  <div class="grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-2">
    <h2 id="about-heading" class="font-display text-3xl font-semibold leading-[1.1] tracking-tight sm:text-[2.6rem]">
      Skill information is scattered. Understanding it shouldn't be.
    </h2>
    <div class="space-y-5 text-[0.95rem] leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground sm:text-base">
      <p>Information about skills, tasks and occupations lives across many different taxonomies. Each one uses its own terminology, its own structure and its own level of granularity. Comparing them by hand is slow, and the connections between them are easy to miss.</p>
      <p>Talent Angels makes that landscape navigable through ordinary conversation — so a question phrased in everyday language returns grounded, traceable answers drawn from structured sources.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Band>
